<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=5><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US>4</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">．市直学校联系社区名单<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
